    "- Perfect number: $s(6)=1+2+3=6$\n",
    "- Amicable pair: $s(220)=284,\\ s(284)=220$\n",
    "- Prime number: $s(p)=1$ (the only proper divisor of a prime is 1)# Part 1: Project Background and Mathematical Definitions\n"
